RPC URL for Sepolia (Alchemy, Infura, or a public endpoint).
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.example/YOUR_KEY

Deployer key for a test account. Leave empty until you fill .env locally.
Never commit .env or a real private key.
PRIVATE_KEY=

Optional whole-token supply minted to the deployer (18 decimals).
Default 0 so attested mints can use the 1000000 ECO cap. A value above 1000000 reverts.
INITIAL_SUPPLY=0

Optional RPC for the generic l2 network in hardhat.config.js.
L2_RPC_URL=

Optional. When set, a Sepolia deploy verifies the source on Etherscan.
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=
